  "notes": "Ancient composition identified by the conventional modern English label Laws of Hammurapi. Hammurapi belongs to its received label and royal framing; authorship and historical legal use require their own evidence. Physical witnesses such as Louvre SB 8, CDLI Q006387/P464358 records, modern critical editions, the conventional 282-section sequence, and translations provide separately identified routes into the composition.",
